{"parse": {"title": "11TH-24", "pageid": 110492, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-23\" title=\"11TH-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-24</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">24</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B1.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"山\">山</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 山</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Hill</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>字<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>千<span class=\"color-value\"></span>万<span class=\"color-value\"></span>分<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11124</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_gongmu4\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_gongmu4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一座完成的山。<br />无法企及死亡的千万分之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它扔下了过往的一切：一件大衣，一顶头盔，一双短靴……一只蝴蝶封面的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——曾属于名叫保罗的年轻人的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你的战争结束了，保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遗物被妥善安葬在最后一处坟墓中，紧挨着一位在山顶死去的少校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处有渐近的马蹄声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……安德烈森？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声轻柔到几乎像是不想吵醒任何人的呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它在软烂的泥土路上驻足，片刻之后，蹄声踏破晨雾，徐徐靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一匹黑马出现在收尸人面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它轻吐鼻息，渴望一次轻抚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>好孩子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你消失了很长一段时间——你又去了一些过于危险的地方寻找你丢失的好友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>或许在你身上附着着某种特殊的命运，使你能在这场屠杀中躲过众多致命的威胁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但我仍然担心流弹与毒气会将你置于死地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>……咴咴——咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马儿低下了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我没有在责备你，安德烈森，相反，你能重新回到我身边，令我心怀感激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亡者看向东方。日光升起之地，噩兆的乌云弥漫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>该走了……下一个目的地无比遥远，我正需要你的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>——咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安德烈森向一侧偏头，示意主人注意早就靠到近前的青年人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>卡戎先生，这匹马是你的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到这时，迟钝的亡者才注意到有人向自己打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……是的，年轻人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>那就没关系了。这匹马突然出现在蒙佩附近，我还以为和重塑之手有关系，就一直追了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>基金会仍然留在蒙佩吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>我们很快就会离开，军队需要转移到更安全的地方去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>对了，你知道“乌鸫”去了哪里吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>“乌鸫”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>噢，梅蕾尔，就是那个和你一起去前线的女孩。她在重塑之手发动袭击之后就失联了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>我正在找她……希望她不要出什么事才好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她还活着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意外的收获。<br />青年的眼中显露出明显的光彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>她还活着？！——你见过她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……我不能告诉你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光彩瞬间熄灭，帕拉维扬怎么也没想到会在这个问题上遭到拒绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她不希望你们找到她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>什……什么？难道她不想回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的。她很害怕之后的战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>真实的杀戮，直白的死亡……对这位少女来说，她或许没有做好接受这一切的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她向我索要了一个承诺，不将她的行踪透露给基金会的诸位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>……我……我不懂，你就这么放她走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>她一个人待着不会更危险吗？而且……她的档案会被记录为“逃亡”……天呐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我不明白你说的这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但我的承诺如此，也理解她的恐慌。每个人都有正当的理由去逃避畏惧的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年从来没有想过要怎么应付眼前的场景，只觉得有一种力量无处挥舞的别扭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他急躁地抓挠着头发，最终做出了决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>好吧……至少她还活着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>我会另想办法找到她的，不能让她一个人在外面游荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清澈的声音做出承诺，他仿佛刚刚接受了一项艰巨的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-526301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“警官”：</div><div>感谢你提供的信息。再见，卡戎先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年踏上返回蒙佩的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一刻钟后，他的背影隐没在东部的树林里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“草丛”：</div><div>“沙沙——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……他走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴咴——咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女从草丛中蹿出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>你怎么告诉他我还活着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你没有让我不说这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亡者点头致意，缓缓离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安德烈森打着响鼻，在卡戎与梅蕾尔之间绕着圈徘徊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔轻拍马儿的面颊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>那个……卡戎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>其实……我并没有打算在这里当一个守墓人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>死者不需要陪伴，作为纪念的墓碑也有朽烂的一日，最终，时间会将我们带入遗忘之海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>没有任何事物值得以不朽为名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻女孩挠了挠遮脸的布料，或者是成为“逃兵”的紧张，让她的皮肤感到有些发痒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>好吧，关于守墓人的玩笑很差劲……我想说的是，我不知道该去哪里……离开基金会之后，我不认识其他能帮我的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我更不想被重塑之手的人抓到，你不知道他们在南极都做了些什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>噢……不是这个时代的南极，是之前的南极。总之我一个人完全没办法对付他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>可我还是能做一些事的，一些讨人厌的魔精我能很轻松地对付。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>所以……如果你……需要，嗯，帮手的话，我们……可以一起走？至少你不会撒谎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我并不会去一个安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>等遇到危险的时候，我自己就会逃跑的。这点你就放心吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……既然如此，请跟上我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不想经过基金会监视地区的话，我们要绕一个更远的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它从衣兜内拿出一根只有半截的巧克力，即使一直贴身存放，也并未融化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>如果你饿了，这些东西都可以还给你。如果你累了，安德烈森可以驮着你前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从战争中逃脱的士兵雀跃地点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……好、好的！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……有关《暴雨改革》法案的修订已经提上日程，委员会很快就会开启下一轮协商，你也要出席会议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>近期的事件令“鹰派”掌握了较大话语权，他们都很支持扩大司辰小队的权责与预算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>做好准备，维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>基金会职员与委员们在走廊中匆忙地穿行而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刚退出Z女士的办公室，就再度听见了熟悉的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>……司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你在等我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>只是凑巧而已。不过我很高兴你能记得我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>当然。你的行动拯救了很多士兵的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>蒙佩的危机解除之后，“鸽派”也同意了扩大“前线应急预案”的决议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>呵呵……没想到你还关心政治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我不关心，只是有所了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻雷乌斯毫不在意地抛开了政治话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>上次的会面太过仓促，我一直想找个机会继续……不过，这里也并不是个适合谈话的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>但我或许可以给你提供一些有价值的简单情报。有关于基金会，有关于……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>“兀尔德”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看见预料之中的反应，男人露出笑容，将一枚信封递了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>期待你的联络。我想，我们一定能合作愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-302302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-302302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-302302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……司辰，打扰一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手匆匆赶来，以疑问和警惕参半的目光看向红发男子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>请问您有什么要紧事吗，刻雷乌斯先生？如果您有需要，我可以帮你们安排会议时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>不必，我们只是偶然遇见问候一下而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>下次再见，司辰，十四行诗小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人微微点头，随后匆匆走远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰？你还好吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……没什么。你看起来很匆忙，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手神色不安地拿出通讯器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，我是来给你看这个的。这是一则紧急留言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>联络人……红弩箭？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受索姆将军直接调遣，我正在东线执行任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头儿，猜猜看我发现了……&amp;%#……什么？一个管辖……*#@……外的……￥%&amp;#……芝诺驻扎地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>根据我的判断，这是……*&amp;%……叛军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>详情……$#@……尽快回电。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>留言在一阵杂音中结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我收到留言后就尝试过联络红弩箭小姐，但……呼叫无法接通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>她在留言中提到了芝诺的叛军，我担心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……是伊戈尔？红弩箭有麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，和我回一趟Z女士的办公室。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-24"}}